# Claude Code per-developer local settings
.claude/

# anydocs-ask index database (local persistence; see ARCHITECTURE.md §3)
.anydocs-ask/

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
*.log
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# npm pack tarballs — built on-demand, never committed
*.tgz

